{
  "document_id": "legacy/story/725efc540ee1/ch09",
  "extensions": {
    "legacy": {
      "chapter": 9,
      "location": "隊伍抵達亞克斯王城,遭禁衛軍隊長萊汀率兵攔截逮捕,誤認他們是刺殺國王的嫌疑犯。交手後萊汀道出宮中生變——刺客曾夜襲國王寢宮,禁衛軍統領葛雷趁機假借王命發號施令;萊汀察覺自己受葛雷矇騙,倒戈加入隊伍護送公主殺入王城,途中卻傳來葛雷遇刺身亡的消息。",
      "source_dat": "FDTXT_009",
      "title": "第九章 — 王城遇襲,葛雷之死"
    }
  },
  "kind": "story",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": null
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/0/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "希莉亞,看來妳父王的大軍已經在等我們了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/0/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "放心,交給我就是了。"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/725efc540ee1/scenes/0"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "萊汀攔截,質疑公主身分"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "萊汀"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/725efc540ee1/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "text": "殿下,以您王國公主的身份怎可和這些盜匪為伍?陛下已下令逮捕這幫盜賊,讓屬下迎接殿下回宮,這些盜匪交給禁衛軍處理就可以了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/1/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "萊汀,我一直以為你是個聰明人,難道連你也不相信我嗎?趕快把這些禁衛軍撤走,我要去見父王,把事情說個清楚。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "萊汀"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/725efc540ee1/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "text": "公主殿下,陛下有令在先,把這幫匪徒通通抓起來再說,如果您還是要護著他們的話,那屬下就得罪了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/1/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "萊汀,你敢對我動手!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "萊汀"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/1/lines/4",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/725efc540ee1/scenes/1/lines/4",
          "text": "公主殿下,請原諒屬下的無禮。來人,把這群盜匪都給我抓起來!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/725efc540ee1/scenes/1"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "宮廷生變真相"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "萊汀"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/2/lines/0",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/725efc540ee1/scenes/2/lines/0",
          "text": "唔..公主殿下,您為何..為何要帶這些人來加害陛下.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/2/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "萊汀,我怎麼會想要加害父王!宮中到底發生了什麼事?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "萊汀"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/2/lines/2",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/725efc540ee1/scenes/2/lines/2",
          "text": ".前幾天有刺客夜襲陛下的寢宮,想要抓走陛下,幸好打鬥聲驚動了侍衛,衛兵衝進來救駕,陛下才倖免於難.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/2/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "有這種事?!說下去!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "萊汀"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/2/lines/4",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/725efc540ee1/scenes/2/lines/4",
          "text": "刺客臨走前還揚言,幾天之內一定會再來..陛下遭到這種驚嚇,幾天來一直在床上休養.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/2/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "這件事又為何會扯到我們身上?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "萊汀"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/2/lines/6",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/725efc540ee1/scenes/2/lines/6",
          "text": "為了搜查可疑份子,我們在王國各地派出調查隊,結果又發現了不少怪事,例如普里茲港的失蹤事件,而你們又惹上了調查隊,結果.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/2/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "大臣們一致認為我們就是刺客?這太荒謬了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "萊汀"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/2/lines/8",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/725efc540ee1/scenes/2/lines/8",
          "text": "葛雷大人相當支持這種說法,所以命令我們禁衛軍派兵攻擊你們.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/2/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "不是父王下令的嗎?怎麼又變成葛雷了?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "萊汀"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/2/lines/10",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/725efc540ee1/scenes/2/lines/10",
          "text": "陛下多日來一直臥病在床,軍令方面都是經由葛雷大人發佈.."
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/725efc540ee1/scenes/2"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "Y控訴,萊汀倒戈"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "Y"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/3/lines/0",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/725efc540ee1/scenes/3/lines/0",
          "text": "禁衛軍隊長萊汀,想不到你竟敢和盜匪勾結,我們奉葛雷大人之命將你逮捕!趕快束手就擒吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "萊汀"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/3/lines/1",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/725efc540ee1/scenes/3/lines/1",
          "text": "可惡,我明白了,葛雷這個該死的叛徒.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/3/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "萊汀,照這樣看來,父王處境危險,我們先設法殺進去再說!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "萊汀"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/3/lines/3",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/725efc540ee1/scenes/3/lines/3",
          "text": "殿下,屬下被奸人所騙,有負保護陛下的使命,請讓屬下和你們一起去!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/3/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "你受傷這麼重,還是先.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/3/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "喂!希莉亞,現在情況緊急,我看這傢伙蠻能打的,叫瑪琳用法術給他治一下傷就可以上陣了,應該可以多少幫上點忙吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/3/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "索爾,你說話也客氣點.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "萊汀"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/3/lines/7",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/725efc540ee1/scenes/3/lines/7",
          "text": "公主殿下,請給屬下一個將功贖罪的機會!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/3/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "這不就好了嗎?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/3/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "好吧,容我再借重一次大家的力量!我們上!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/725efc540ee1/scenes/3"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "葛雷遇害"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "莎"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/4/lines/0",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/725efc540ee1/scenes/4/lines/0",
          "text": "不得了了!葛雷大人被殺了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "萊汀"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/4/lines/1",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/725efc540ee1/scenes/4/lines/1",
          "text": "把話講清楚一點!倒底是怎麼一回事?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "莎"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/4/lines/2",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/725efc540ee1/scenes/4/lines/2",
          "text": "我..我是葛雷大人房外的衛兵,剛才忽然聽到房內傳出一陣慘叫聲,我衝進去一看,葛雷大人已經倒在地上不省人事了.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "萊汀"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/4/lines/3",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/725efc540ee1/scenes/4/lines/3",
          "text": "有這種事!公主殿下,看來王城內情勢險惡,我先進去探查一番,再回來向殿下報告!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/725efc540ee1/scenes/4/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "小心點!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/725efc540ee1/scenes/4"
    }
  ],
